-- =============================================================
-- REQUIRED MANUAL STEP AFTER RUNNING THIS SCRIPT
-- =============================================================
-- Every role created above was given the placeholder password
-- ''CHANGE_ME_BOOTSTRAP_PLACEHOLDER''. Immediately after this script
-- succeeds, set each role's real password, e.g.:
--   ALTER ROLE stockiha_runtime PASSWORD '<value from Credential Manager or runtime.key>';
--   ALTER ROLE stockiha_migrator PASSWORD '<...>';
--   ALTER ROLE stockiha_backup PASSWORD '<...>';
-- Do this interactively (psql \password) so the value is never captured in
-- shell history or a script argument. See docs/recovery/RESTORE_PROCEDURE.md.
